i2pd (2.61.0-3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The SysV fallback starts the foreground router in the background as the
    dedicated i2pd user. The systemd unit uses systemd's native
    StateDirectory=/RuntimeDirectory= for /var/lib/i2pd and /run/i2pd; the
    tmpfiles policy creates those paths plus /var/log/i2pd when
    systemd-tmpfiles is used.
  * If you copied an older i2pd.service or started i2pd from a custom
    foreground unit, review or remove that copy before upgrading. Two units
    can start two routers against the same /var/lib/i2pd and corrupt it.
  * The ncurses TUI is now in the separate i2pd-tui package. Install it if
    you use i2pd-tui; the i2pd package no longer ships that binary.
  * Configuration stays in /etc/i2pd. The old /var/lib/i2pd configuration and
    tunnel symlinks are no longer created; only the certificate compatibility
    link is retained.

 -- openi2pd maintainers <daviduhden@users.noreply.github.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
